母。","fixed_source_fact_binding":{"kind":"fixed_witness_person_fact_slots","key":"jin035-peiwei-finite","slot":"gai-spouse"},"subject_person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_AABB","object_person_id":"q3a_4vw_3q1","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"該時尚主","source_interpretation_status":"explicit_source_wording"}}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p002:m0190","start":190,"end":191,"surface":"主","kind":"person","person_id":"q3a_4vw_3q1","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"該時尚主明單一婚配對象，名字與父母未明，不補為最近皇帝女。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p002","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin035-peiwei-gai-spouse","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-035","source_id":"s-jinshu-035-ws2506399-peiwei","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p002","quote":"初，頠兄子憬為白衣，頠論述世勳，賜爵高陽亭侯。楊駿將誅也，駿党左軍將軍劉豫陳兵在門，遇頠，問太傅所在。頠紿之曰：「向於西掖門遇公乘素車，從二人西出矣。」豫曰：「吾何之？」頠曰：「宜至廷尉。」豫從頠言，遂委而去。尋而詔頠代豫領左軍將軍，屯萬春門。及駿誅，以功當封武昌侯，頠請以封憬，帝竟封頠次子該。頠苦陳憬本承嫡，宜襲钜鹿，先帝恩旨，辭不獲命。武昌之封，己之所蒙，特請以封憬。該時尚主，故帝不聽。累遷侍中。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p002:m0187","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-035-peiwei:p002:m0190"}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"interpretation_note":"尚主明婚配，公主來源內已登記但未名；不補生母。","fixed_source_fact_binding":{"kind":"fixed_witness_person_fact_slots","key":"jin035-peiwei-finite","slot":"gai-spouse"},"subject_person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_AABB","object_person_id":"q3a_4vw_3q1","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"該時尚主","source_interpretation_status":"explicit_source_wording"}}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],